# This repository will be public. Keep working files and pilot data out of git.
# See CLAUDE.md rules 12-13 and docs/content_inventory.md, section e.

# Working files: pilot snapshot, extracted data, check output, local copies of pilot data
build/

# Local copies of pilot data, if ever made outside build/
nrfr-pilot/
data/
local/

# Raw and source file types that never belong in this repository
